# =============================================================================
# helpers/prod/api.http — production / staging HTTP checks
# Domains (prod):  https://greetup.co | https://api.greetup.co | https://rtc.greetup.co
# Domains (staging, if in use): staging / api-staging / rtc-staging .greetup.co
# =============================================================================

@prod_web = https://greetup.co
@prod_api = https://api.greetup.co
@prod_rtc = https://rtc.greetup.co

@staging_web = https://staging.greetup.co
@staging_api = https://api-staging.greetup.co
@staging_rtc = https://rtc-staging.greetup.co

# @cookie = better-auth.session_token=PASTE_ME
# @internalKey = PASTE_INTERNAL_API_KEY

### ── Public health / reachability ────────────────────────────────────────────

### Prod web
GET {{prod_web}}/
Accept: text/html

### Prod API root
GET {{prod_api}}/

### Prod RTC health (Caddy → rtc-service)
GET {{prod_rtc}}/health

### Staging web
GET {{staging_web}}/

### Staging API
GET {{staging_api}}/

### Staging RTC
GET {{staging_rtc}}/health

### WWW → apex redirect (expect 301 to https://greetup.co/)
GET https://www.greetup.co/
Accept: text/html

### HTTP → HTTPS on www (follow manually / use curl -sI)
GET http://www.greetup.co/

### ── Auth / session (needs cookie from a real browser login) ─────────────────

### Get session
GET {{prod_api}}/api/auth/get-session
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Profile me
GET {{prod_api}}/api/profile/me
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### OTC me
GET {{prod_api}}/api/open-to-connect/me
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Notifications unread
GET {{prod_api}}/api/notifications/unread-count
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### ── Internal (server-to-server; do not expose key) ───────────────────────────

### Internal root probe (expects API key middleware — adjust path if needed)
GET {{prod_api}}/internal/
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{internalKey}}

# ── curl (PowerShell / bash) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

# curl.exe -sI https://greetup.co/
# curl.exe -sI https://www.greetup.co/
# curl.exe -s  https://api.greetup.co/
# curl.exe -s  https://rtc.greetup.co/health
# curl.exe -sI https://staging.greetup.co/
# curl.exe -s  https://api-staging.greetup.co/
# curl.exe -s  https://rtc-staging.greetup.co/health
#
# curl.exe -s https://api.greetup.co/api/auth/get-session -H "Cookie: better-auth.session_token=PASTE"
# curl.exe -s https://api.greetup.co/api/profile/me -H "Cookie: better-auth.session_token=PASTE"
#
# # TLS / CDN quick look
# curl.exe -sI https://api.greetup.co/ | Select-String -Pattern "HTTP/|cf-ray|server|location"
# curl.exe -sI https://rtc.greetup.co/health | Select-String -Pattern "HTTP/|server"
